<speak>Good afternoon. Yes, I'm at home, in the room I have rather optimistically started calling my study. The door is closed, and I have put the business telephone elsewhere. That is something of a departure for me. Before we get into the review, here are my details. My identification number is <sub alias="ess">S</sub> four one four nine nine nine nine <sub alias="gee">G</sub>. My date of birth is the first of December nineteen eighty.</speak>